  "Question": "How should the shortest canal from river \\(l\\) to village \\(P\\) be built?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Build it in any direction; the length is the same.",
    "B": "Build it in a direction parallel to \\(l\\).",
    "C": "Draw a perpendicular to \\(l\\) through point \\(P\\) and build along the perpendicular segment, because the perpendicular segment is the shortest.",
